tact Us</button><button data-detail="news">News & Blog</button><button data-detail="affiliate">Affiliate</button><button data-detail="reseller">Become to reseller</button></div><div class="footer-col"><h3>COMMUNITY</h3><button data-social="Facebook Group">Facebook Group ↗</button><button data-social="Reddit">Reddit ↗</button><button data-social="LinkedIn">LinkedIn ↗</button><button data-social="Discord">Discord ↗</button></div></div><div class="footer-mark" aria-label="Palm X，正式品牌字标待接入">Palm X</div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Palm X · 版权信息占位</span><div><button data-detail="privacy">隐私说明</button><button data-detail="terms">使用条款</button><button data-route="home">回到首页 ↑</button></div><span>FROM YOUR HANDS. INTO THE WORLD.</span></div><p class="footer-notice">此为评审草稿。正式 Logo、网站语言、政策、社区地址与经营数据均需最终确认；未部署、无支付、无数据提交。</p></div></footer>
<button class="review-fab" id="reviewOpen"><i></i><span class="desktop-label">整站草稿 · </span>目录与说明</button>
<dialog id="mainDialog" aria-labelledby="dialogTitle"><div class="dialog-top"><h2 id="dialogTitle"></h2><button class="close" id="dialogClose" aria-label="关闭">×</button></div><div class="dialog-content" id="dialogContent"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="reviewDialog" aria-labelledby="reviewTitle"><div class="dialog-top"><h2 id="reviewTitle">整站评审目录</h2><button class="close" id="reviewClose" aria-label="关闭评审目录">×</button></div><div class="review-list"><button data-review-jump="home">Header & Banner <span>现有 v0.3 保留</span></button><button data-review-jump="products">Products 分类 <span>五类 / 可切换</span></button><button data-review-jump="software">Software <span>任务与结果联动</span></button><button data-review-jump="space">Palmx Space <span>自有社区入口</span></button><button data-review-jump="community">Community <span>外部社交平台</span></button><button data-review-jump="explore">Explore <span>应用与资源</span></button><button data-review-jump="#proof">Proof <span>横向案例卡片</span></button><button data-review-jump="#discover">Discover <span>四类应用场景</span></button><button data-review-jump="#materialsTitle">Materials <span>滚动 / 选择 / 影片位</span></button><button data-review-jump="#why">Why choose us <span>图文联动</span></button><button data-review-jump="#service">Our Service <span>服务平铺</span></button><button data-review-jump="#subscribe">Subscribe <span>输入与反馈</span></button><button data-review-jump="#footer">Footer <span>整屏感收尾</span></button><button id="openMediaImports">本地素材接入 <span>加工 / 成品影片</span></button></div><div class="review-status"><p><strong>本轮范围：</strong>按既有案例的方法完成整站整合，不逐段复制其他品牌的字体与配色。</p><p><strong>当前实际素材：</strong>Banner v0.3 原视频与热点；已上传的屏幕进入作业台镜头；现有模型关键帧。没有新增加工影片，也不把已有几何零件当作麒麟。</p><p><strong>仍待补：</strong>正式 Logo、真实软件界面、作品与场景照片、完整立体模型加工片、社区地址、政策和经营信息核验。</p><p>Why choose us 自动触发方式未确认，本稿默认手动，可主动开启定时轮播演示。离开、聚焦或指向时暂停。字体使用本机回退，不代表 Manrope 已验收。</p><p><button class="text-link" id="openReferences">查看各模块参考对应 ↗</button></p></div></dialog>
